{"sections":[{"slug":"Adèle","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Adèle"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Adèle"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Adèle"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p>L’objet de la théorie du corps de classes est de montrer comment les <strong>extensions abéliennes</strong> d’un corps de nombres algébriques $K$ peuvent être déterminées par des éléments tirés de la connaissance de $K$ lui-même; ou, si l’on veut présenter les choses en termes dialectiques, comment un corps possède en soi les éléments de son propre dépassement. (<span lang=\"zh\">类域论的目标是说明一个数域</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">扩张如何由</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">本身的信息决定</span>.)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Grothendieck’s extension of Galois theory to schemes will, in the context of global fields K, acquire a geometric counterpart of adelic nature. — Alain Connes and Caterina Consani, Knots, primes and class field theory</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>Adèle <span lang=\"zh\">将一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/整体域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整体域</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">离散地放在一个</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分析学</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">对象</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">局部紧环</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">局部紧性导致其上有测度可以</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">做分析</span>”.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/整体域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整体域</span>"}},{"Plain":" $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Adèle <span lang=\"zh\">环</span> $\\mathbb A_K$ <span lang=\"zh\">是其所有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/完备化(域)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">完备化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">限制积</span></strong> (restricted product), <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $\\prod_\\nu K_\\nu$ <span lang=\"zh\">中由除有限个位置之外落在整数环</span> $\\mathcal O_\\nu$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的元素构成的子环</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由于整体域</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个元素在有限个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/位","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">位</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上赋值非零</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">故</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">本身嵌入到</span> $\\mathbb A_K$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}